  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0: the stable release of the introspection generation model - mixin.Target as a full reflection-like object model walkable to any depth, bounded incremental builds, typed attribute arguments, the @nullable directive, and a catalog of seventy-four compiled, build-verified samples. Since preview2: nine new samples (variant-interface targets, static-abstract emission, mixin layering, direct System.Type walks, @namespace); new warning MIXIN0502 for generic attribute type arguments the generated file cannot resolve; new error MIXIN0203 for invalid template file names; fixes for global-namespace targets under a RootNamespace, generic-specifier filename parsing, Attribute-suffixed template names, default(enum) arguments, and template-default error attribution; SourceLink with embedded PDBs. Breaking changes against 1.x are listed in CHANGELOG.md.",
